2) the lottery through the bind: the sixteen off the numbers, drawn every season, the table's chances
   30 closed seasons, a lottery drawn on 30 (0 with no level records in the field); 20 of them, 10000 keyed lotteries each: 280 club shares, the worst 2.99 standard errors from the table (band 4.5)
3) the slot is the truth: every pick used once by its holder at its first owner's place
   30 drafts, 1800 picks: 150 of the year's picks moved first (16 his), a club with three or more 30 times, a club with none 30 times; on the clock 46 times; 566 rival rows shown, every one on its club at his scout's read
4) drawn once: the block survives a round trip, every press, a second open and a swapped table
   30 nights: each opened twice to the same block, read back after a JSON round trip, unchanged by every press; 30 opened again after Continue and answered as they stood; 10 drafts replayed with the table swapped under the block
